#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:1
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:3
msgid ""
"`nix-prefetch-url` - copy a file from a URL into the store and print its hash"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:5
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "概要"

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:7
msgid ""
"`nix-prefetch-url` _url_ \\[_hash_\\] \\[`--type` _hashAlgo_\\] \\[`--print-"
"path`\\] \\[`--unpack`\\] \\[`--name` _name_\\]"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:13
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:15
msgid ""
"The command `nix-prefetch-url` downloads the file referenced by the URL "
"_url_, prints its cryptographic hash, and copies it into the Nix store. The "
"file name in the store is `hash-baseName`, where _baseName_ is everything "
"following the final slash in _url_."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:20
msgid ""
"This command is just a convenience for Nix expression writers. Often a Nix "
"expression fetches some source distribution from the network using the "
"`fetchurl` expression contained in Nixpkgs. However, `fetchurl` requires a "
"cryptographic hash. If you don't know the hash, you would have to download "
"the file first, and then `fetchurl` would download it again when you build "
"your Nix expression. Since `fetchurl` uses the same name for the downloaded "
"file as `nix-prefetch-url`, the redundant download can be avoided."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:29
msgid ""
"If _hash_ is specified, then a download is not performed if the Nix store "
"already contains a file with the same hash and base name. Otherwise, the "
"file is downloaded, and an error is signaled if the actual hash of the file "
"does not match the specified hash."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:34
msgid ""
"This command prints the hash on standard output. The hash is printed using "
"[Nix32](../protocols/nix32.md) unless `--type md5` is specified, in which "
"case it's printed using base-16. Additionally, if the option `--print-path` "
"is used, the path of the downloaded file in the Nix store is also printed."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:40
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:42
msgid "`--type` _hashAlgo_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:44
msgid ""
"Use the specified cryptographic hash algorithm, which can be one of "
"`blake3`, `md5`, `sha1`, `sha256`, and `sha512`. The default is `sha256`."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:48
msgid "`--print-path`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:50
msgid "Print the store path of the downloaded file on standard output."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:52
msgid "`--unpack`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:54
msgid ""
"Unpack the archive (which must be a tarball or zip file) and add the result "
"to the Nix store. The resulting hash can be used with functions such as "
"Nixpkgs’s `fetchzip` or `fetchFromGitHub`."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:58
msgid "`--executable`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:60
msgid "Set the executable bit on the downloaded file."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:62
msgid "`--name` _name_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:64
msgid ""
"Override the name of the file in the Nix store. By default, this is `hash-"
"basename`, where _basename_ is the last component of _url_. Overriding the "
"name is necessary when _basename_ contains characters that are not allowed "
"in Nix store paths."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:69
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:71
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-prefetch-url ftp://ftp.gnu.org/pub/gnu/hello/hello-2.10.tar.gz\n"
"0ssi1wpaf7plaswqqjwigppsg5fyh99vdlb9kzl7c9lng89ndq1i\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:76
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-prefetch-url --print-path mirror://gnu/hello/hello-2.10.tar.gz\n"
"0ssi1wpaf7plaswqqjwigppsg5fyh99vdlb9kzl7c9lng89ndq1i\n"
"/nix/store/8alrpdaasjd1x6g1fczchmzbpqm936a3-hello-2.10.tar.gz\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-prefetch-url.md:82
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-prefetch-url --unpack --print-path https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf/"
"archive/0.8.tar.gz\n"
"079agjlv0hrv7fxnx9ngipx14gyncbkllxrp9cccnh3a50fxcmy7\n"
"/nix/store/19zrmhm3m40xxaw81c8cqm6aljgrnwj2-0.8.tar.gz\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
